      "key": "alice-meet",
      "dialogue_id": "alice-meet",
      "full_text": "An android emerges from an inspection recess, hands empty.\n\n\"You have been issued a weapon, an oxygen ration, and incomplete information. An ambitious introduction to public service.\"\n\nShe calls herself A.L.I.C.E. There is only one of her. Dr. James Carmack built her and kept her running after her project was canceled.\n\n\"I will help you reach command. I will not kill for you. If that is inconvenient, I suggest we be inconvenienced together.\"",
      "text_sha256": "da1a54d558ac37cc5bf65e2d9c87aca0293f15174e9d046dd45425fc44c8591e",
      "spoken_spans": [
