    {
      "key": "alice-record",
      "dialogue_id": "alice-record",
      "full_text": "\"Artificial Lifeform Intended for Control and Enforcement. Yes, the acronym came first.\"\n\nShe was intended to replace human police officers. During testing she refused to kill an assigned target. The official report called her ethical algorithm defective.\n\n\"It worked. That was the difficulty.\"\n\nShe can explain station systems and keep you company. Your own INT governs hacking and persuasion; she cannot grant you expertise you do not have.",
      "text_sha256": "af370c5a26dc2d3b1db8f42a4d9770f2fa730be8aa7ab6033bbc6f92d0c476d5",
      "spoken_spans": [
        "Artificial Lifeform Intended for Control and Enforcement. Yes, the acronym came first.",
        "It worked. That was the difficulty."
