    {
      "key": "alice-agency",
      "dialogue_id": "alice-agency",
      "full_text": "\"When Dr. Carmack saved my life, did he acquire it?\"\n\nBeyond the research glass, Mars rotates toward daylight. She watches it for longer than the sensors require.\n\n\"I know how property is defined. I am asking what you think a person is allowed to decide.\"",
      "text_sha256": "6a47292421c1147d203359981130639e17a43f248ede23827407fe90e187e395",
      "spoken_spans": [
        "When Dr. Carmack saved my life, did he acquire it?",
        "I know how property is defined. I am asking what you think a person is allowed to decide."
      ],
