    {
      "key": "sacrifice-plan",
      "dialogue_id": "sacrifice-plan",
      "full_text": "\"My detonation will take the station with me. It is the one command he cannot revoke quickly enough.\"\n\nYou tell her there must be another way. She looks toward the evacuation hatch.\n\n\"If there were, I would be taking it. Your life is not the price of mine. Please reach the pod. I will keep the lock open.\"\n\nThe hatch leads toward Mars. You still have to reach it.",
      "text_sha256": "6c0013c70f6bf47be8c69946461b9f64f64bda17cab9ae12b63551d4661ff451",
      "spoken_spans": [
        "My detonation will take the station with me. It is the one command he cannot revoke quickly enough.",
        "If there were, I would be taking it. Your life is not the price of mine. Please reach the pod. I will keep the lock open."
