    {
      "key": "alice-talk-0",
      "dialogue_id": "alice-talk",
      "full_text": "\"Your suit telemetry is reliable. What you see at the edge of the light may not be. Refill your reserve, then allow your oxygenation to recover. I would prefer to continue this conversation with all of your brain participating.\"",
